# Interactive Course Module: Introduction to Zolto

Welcome to the interactive learning module for Zolto. Work through the lesson, practice with flashcards, and test your knowledge!

---

## 1. Lesson Overview

> [!NOTE]
> Zolto combines Markdown, Mathematics, Diagrams, Charts, Vector Graphics, Spatial Layouts, Components, and Interactive Widgets into a unified zero-dependency language.

---

## 2. Interactive Study Flashcards

@deck ZoltoBasics {

  @card
    front "What is Zolto?"
    back "A zero-dependency document engine and Markdown superset."
  @end

  @card
    front "Which phase introduced Vector Graphics?"
    back "Phase 7 introduced the native @vector drawing engine."
  @end

  @card
    front "What syntax creates a reusable component?"
    back "component Name(props) ... end"
  @end

}

---

## 3. Self-Assessment Quiz

@quiz "Module 1 Assessment" {

  @mcq "How many external dependencies does Zolto require?" {
    @correct "Zero dependencies"
    @choice "5 npm packages"
    @choice "12 WebAssembly modules"
  }

  @truefalse "Zolto components can be nested and support slot injection."
  answer true

  @blank "What keyword defines a template in Phase 9?"
  answer "template"

  @match {
    Phase 7 -> Vector Engine
    Phase 8 -> Spatial Layout
    Phase 9 -> Component System
    Phase 10 -> Interactive Documents
  }

}

